          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Consists of&#160;50,838,840 shares of common stock issuable upon conversion of the 1,200,000 shares of Series&#160;B Preferred Stock held by the BVF Funds. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
